---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About FIRECalc — Free FIRE Retirement Calculator" description="FIRECalc is a free, open-source FIRE calculator that helps you plan your path to financial independence and early retirement.">
  <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-6 md:p-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">🔥 About FIRECalc</h1>
    
    <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p><strong>FIRECalc</strong> is a free online calculator that helps you answer the most important question in personal finance: <em>"When can I retire?"</em></p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-4">How It Works</h2>
      <p>Enter your income, savings rate, current portfolio, and expected investment returns. Our calculator uses the proven <strong>4% rule</strong> (adjustable) to determine your FIRE number — the amount you need to save to achieve financial independence.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-4">Features</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
        <li>Calculate your exact <strong>FIRE Number</strong></li>
        <li>See your <strong>Years to FIRE</strong> and <strong>FIRE Age</strong></li>
        <li>Track <strong>milestones</strong> (25%, 50%, 75%, 100%)</li>
        <li>Visualize your path with <strong>interactive charts</strong></li>
        <li>Adjust for <strong>inflation</strong> and <strong>withdrawal rate</strong></li>
        <li>Distinguish between <strong>Lean FIRE, Regular FIRE, and Fat FIRE</strong></li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-4">Disclaimer</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">This calculator is for educational purposes only. It does not constitute financial advice. Always consult a qualified financial advisor before making investment decisions. Past performance does not guarantee future results.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>